Stay right here!

108
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:03,793
Jack, you got ten, 15 feet.

109
00:09:03,918 --> 00:09:05,879
Bring him down.
Bring him down.

110
00:09:11,593 --> 00:09:13,887
Aah!

111
00:09:53,802 --> 00:09:55,720
Aah!

