Yeah.

125
00:11:45,789 --> 00:11:49,292
Uh, probationary firefighter
Jack Morrison reporting, sir.

126
00:11:51,294 --> 00:11:52,587
Sir?

127
00:11:55,006 --> 00:11:56,800
Sir?

128
00:12:02,806 --> 00:12:04,800
