Let him go first.

143
00:12:50,403 --> 00:12:52,889
Go ahead. Go ahead, Jack.

144
00:12:52,989 --> 00:12:56,985
Yeah, so, Jack... Ok.

145
00:12:57,110 --> 00:12:59,487
