'Bless me, Father...'

161
00:13:48,211 --> 00:13:50,789
Uh, bless me, Father, for I have sinned.

162
00:13:50,914 --> 00:13:53,158
It's been, uh...

163
00:13:53,258 --> 00:13:55,911
